	Let $L\in(0,2\pi)$ be fixed and consider the periodic traveling wave solution
\begin{equation}\label{Sol2}
\varphi(x) = 2\operatorname{arctanh}\biggl(k\sn\biggl(\frac{4K(k)}{L} \  x ; k\biggr)\biggr),
