\begin{thm} \label{pos_seq_ent}
    There is a rank one system $(X,\cB,\mu,T)$ with sequence of tower heights $h_n$ such that $h^A(T)>0$, in addition to either one of the following constraints:
    \begin{enumerate}[label=(\roman*)]
        \item \label{pos_seq_ent.1}  For some $\alpha, \beta > 0$ where $\alpha \ge 1+1/\beta$, $A=\lfloor n^\alpha \rfloor$ and
