\]
We define an order on monomials with operations $[\cdot,\cdot]$ and $\{\cdot,\cdot\}$ by
\begin{itemize}
    \item $[[\cdot,\cdot],\cdot]>[\{\cdot,\cdot\},\cdot]>\{[\cdot,\cdot],\cdot\}>\{\{\cdot,\cdot\},\cdot\}$;
    \item the remaining monomials are ordered by lexicographical order;
\end{itemize}
Let $\mathcal{R}$ be a set of relations in $\mathcal{LS}$ in terms of $[\cdot,\cdot]$ and $\{\cdot,\cdot\}$, i.e., we have
\begin{multline*}
(ab)c-a(bc)+b(ac)-(ba)c=1/4([[a,b],c]+[\{a,b\},c]+\{[a,b],c\}+\{\{a,b\},c\}\\
