\begin{thm}\label{thm1_2}
Let $\Omega \subset \mathbb{R}^n$ $(n \geq 3)$ be a smooth bounded domain. Assume that $D(s)$ and $S(s)$ satisfy $(\ref{eq1.2})$ as well as
\begin{align}\label{D-g}
