long-time solution of (\ref{2020C}):

\begin{theorem}
\label{T1A}Let $(M,\xi,\eta,g,\Phi,\omega)$ be a complete noncompact Sasakian
$(2n+1)$-manifold with nonnegative transverse bisectional curvature. Suppose
that there exists a constant $C_{2}>0$ such that
\[\begin{array}
