Let $\mathcal{L}$ be innately regular, $\lambda\in\left]0,1\right]$, and $x^{(0)}\in X$.
Generate a sequence $(x^{(n)})_{\nnn}$ in $X$ as follows:
Given $x^{(n)}$, pick $R_n \in \mathcal{R}_{\mathcal{L},[\lambda,2-\lambda]}$, and update via
\begin{equation}
  \begingroup
